{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"grep flags for omit, exact, recursive, line numbers, context, and finding files by content.","label":"grep","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/gpg","label":"gpg","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/gpg"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/history","label":"history","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/history"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>grep<\/code> searches for a pattern in a file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>grep 'pattern' &lt;file&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Flags<\/h2>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-v<\/code> \u2014 omit matching lines<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-x<\/code> \u2014 exact match<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-r<\/code> \u2014 recursive<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-n<\/code> \u2014 line numbers<\/div><\/li>\n\t\t<li><div><code class='inline'>-w<\/code> \u2014 word match<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>Context<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-A &lt;n&gt;<\/code> prints n lines after the match.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-B &lt;n&gt;<\/code> prints n lines before the match.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Find file with content<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>grep -rnw ['&lt;directory&gt;'] -e &lt;[\"]pattern[\"]&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Multiple<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;term_1&gt;\/|&lt;term_2&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/grep\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/grep\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/gpg' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/gpg' data-title='gpg' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>gpg<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/history' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/history' data-title='history' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>history<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/nix.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level t